{"failure_id": "FAIL-2026091904", "timestamp": "2026-09-19T04:53:58Z", "category": "runtime", "severity": "high", "error_message": "npm audit classified a HIGH vulnerability in a DIRECT runtime dependency as dev-only: is_runtime keyed on npm's `effects` list, which enumerates the vuln's dependents and is [] for direct deps (verified live: lodash@4.17.15, isDirect=true, effects=[] never blocked)", "root_cause": "misread audit schema semantics; also npm-missing/timeout/empty/unparseable output all returned (0,0,[]) — indistinguishable from 'no vulnerabilities'", "affected_files": ["scripts/regression_audit.py"], "fix_commit": "8a797b2", "regression_pattern": "any\\(eff in \\(runtime_deps or set\\(\\)\\) for eff in effects\\) if runtime_deps", "prevention_rule": "runtime classification uses npm's isDirect plus name-in-runtime_deps plus effect chains; audit tooling failures surface as warnings with a named reason, never green; tests/test_regression_audit.py locks the direct-dep shape", "status": "resolved", "file_glob": ["scripts/*.py"], "updated_at": "2026-09-19T04:55:07Z"}
